{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "description": "S4.1.2/S6.1.2: native int pairs preserve null and poison. The comparison procedure also inlines its explicitly float-typed consumer, so only the integer prefix forbids floating conversion. Full-width null-store tests retain checked fallback and nullable predicates use the 0/1/2 bool lane.",
